  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "Catalan Numbers\n\nProblem Statement:\n\nWrite a program to generate the first N Catalan numbers, where N is given as input.\n\nThe first few Catalan numbers for n = 0, 1, 2, 3, \u2026 are 1, 1, 2, 5, 14, 42, 132, 429, 1430, 4862, \u2026\n\n\nCatalan numbers satisfy the following recursive formula. \n\nC_0=1 \\ and \\ C_{n+1}=\\sum_{i=0}^{n}C_iC_{n-i} \\ for \\ n\\geq 0",
    "constraints": [
      "1 <= N <= 30"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Given an Integer",
    "outputFormat": "Print Catalan numbers under the range",
    "notes": [],
